# `next turn` on the game screen.
#
# **The status text is the assertion.** `P-608`: *a status bar, always present, that I can check the
# text of* - so a turn advancing is visible as the text changing, and the screen does not move.

{test name:next-turn-advances-the-turn-and-the-status}

{given}
{screen name:game}
{status text:turn 7} -> 1

{when}
{next-turn}

{then}
{screen name:game}
{status text:turn 8} -> 1
{view of:game name:goldberg} -> 1
{item of:game name:next-turn active:1} -> 1
{item of:game name:menu active:1} -> 1
{attention of:next-turn}
